      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that's a good start. but some people in town are arguing that \"preserving heritage\" is just a way to exclude new people or resist progress. they think the town should be more focused on embracing new cultures rather than clinging to the old ones. can you add a section that addresses those concerns or helps explain why focusing on tradition isn't necessarily about excluding others?",
